# Web3Forms access key that routes Custom Work's inquiry field to
# keani@boxcutter.com (lib/content.ts's CONTACT_EMAIL). Get one free, no
# account needed, at https://web3forms.com — just enter that email and it
# emails you a key instantly.
#
# Without this set, the field falls back to a mailto: link instead of
# failing silently.
#
# Set the same value in Vercel's project env settings for production
# (this file's values aren't deployed).
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
